The '''Overgrown Mushroom Cave''' is a sub-location in the {{Zone|Mushroom Desert}}.

{{ZoneText|Farm mushrooms.}}

== Location ==
The area is really similar to the {{Zone|Glowing Mushroom Cave}}, which is connected to it, and contains one small water pool. The location has a mossy feel and has a lot of Jungle Leaves around the place. Players can find [[Mushroom]] trees, [[Mushrooms]] and {{MobSprite|Mooshroom}}s in the area. It can be used to access the {{Zone|Mushroom Gorge}} or the {{Zone|Glowing Mushroom Cave}}.

